#tr.en: Inscription of a vessel.
3'. sar-ru-gi
#tr.en: Sargon,
4'. _lugal_ a-ga-de3{ki}
#tr.en: king of Agade,
5'. _sag-gesz-ra_
#tr.en: conquerer
6'. _sag_ unu{ki#}
#tr.en: of Uruk
$ rest broken
